ve: Awesome, Calvin! Keep pushing and making music, it'll remind us why we keep hustling.\nL98: [S4T27] (dia_id: D4:27)\nL99: \nL100: Calvin: Yeah, Dave! The road can be hard, but when we remember why we're doing it, it keeps us going. Let's keep each other motivated!","content_sha256":"c724c967ab58a89bed4e977594b5cd7b875fdda940fdd39f1ac83d1427c50167","coverage":[{"line_end":100,"line_start":80,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-04.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":21,"result_sha256":"0e8d9cf3ea804836630614c54800b793ae9f6731a587f91f4fb78cd312c1c5dd","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
