it, which represents my love for art and the sea. It's one of my favorites!\nL56: [S16T14] (dia_id: D16:14)\nL57: \nL58: Dave: That's a great guitar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special.\nL59: [S16T15] (dia_id: D16:15)\nL60: \nL61: Calvin: Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made.\nL62: [S16T16] (dia_id: D16:16)\nL63: \nL64: Dave: Wow, Calvin, this instrument obviously means a lot to you - it's like a representation of your journey, your passion for music, and the friendships you've made. Amazing!\nL65: [S16T17] (dia_id: D16:17)\nL66: \nL67: Calvin: Yeah, Dave! It's like every mark and strum holds a story. Take a look.\nL68: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a purple glow on it]\nL69: [S16T18] (dia_id: D16:18)\nL70: ","content_sha256":"a6c5c7dd4dd5d0baca53aedd160713c43f8121e6e99183886f36f64b14bc6064","coverage":[{"line_end":70,"line_start":40,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-16.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":31,"result_sha256":"5635b87df5af41725c9416432476b7655c4ff85274cd17bbe4d5cf4e24d5f40a","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
